    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a game about puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393420/extras/14432781c2b2101db2116350f8711a37.poster.avif?t=1745754078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393420/extras/14432781c2b2101db2116350f8711a37.webm?t=1745754078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393420/extras/14432781c2b2101db2116350f8711a37.mp4?t=1745754078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a beautiful elven mage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fighting, no time pressure, no death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just puzzles\u2014and an elven mage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crates, pattern matching, spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something dark lurking beneath it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music: Alexandr Zhelanov</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a game about puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393420/extras/14432781c2b2101db2116350f8711a37.poster.avif?t=1745754078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393420/extras/14432781c2b2101db2116350f8711a37.webm?t=1745754078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393420/extras/14432781c2b2101db2116350f8711a37.mp4?t=1745754078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a beautiful elven mage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fighting, no time pressure, no death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just puzzles\u2014and an elven mage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crates, pattern matching, spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something dark lurking beneath it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music: Alexandr Zhelanov</p>",
